<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is moving to block exports of chemicals used in Myanmar rare-earth mining while advancing the ASEAN Express cross-border rail freight service. Police chiefs have been instructed to tighten security along the Thai border as Shan State delegates discuss cross-border river pollution and Thailand and Myanmar begin talks over Chiang Rai river toxins. A Chanthaburi man confessed to an acid attack on his wife out of jealousy, and Cambodia protested a Thai military visit and new bunker on their contested border. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPTUpVSzRCWG9FWnBKRlB2M19GV3FJdDFtWFJjWDVJZjVDM24xTUN1WVRJLUY0a1Zvdy1zNUtuMEFIRzA4UElfWVpPY18xSHFUb2NGNkQtVkRhXzJfQVFrS2tYYkwzQ3ppTFZVSVY4SC02Z2JzcFc2SkdzakFjUkl4TFhhTWQ5U3dSQVZkNkt3NVU3c203SlY4bi1LRHhsa3d1cVJWUmdoSkJYeS1YSzB5eE1ESkM0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Phnom Penh Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Intelligence Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE1aTjZsdXJVSnhUWE1MdlZqTURKT1hWdlJOeG8zcEtlN1l4VTRVSk9rd3lIaFZKTHpZdUItc2VrMWwwZ1pkbkpkbDR0RjdFakpaYlVLQTNwcEpBUF9VQUtwRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOeXVSWWFReHFzRjJFaDQtNG5QY1ctNVdRaTJQZzZMakNHSS1sNkNnM2xrbGJJU2d